      "text": "WHY TESTOZA Everything a real exam needs, nothing it doesn't Three things separate an assessment platform from a form builder. TestoZa does all three. Turn any source into a paper Upload a PDF, paste a YouTube link, or drop in raw text. AI writes MCQs, numericals, true/false and multi-select questions with explanations — then hands you an editable draft, not a locked export. See PDF to quiz Exam integrity that actually holds Full-screen enforcement, tab-switch detection, copy-paste lock, and question and option randomisation. Violations are logged, and you choose whether to warn, lock, or auto",
